# 🟢 1️⃣1️⃣ Real Production Dashboard Example

Management wants:

* Total revenue today
* Total successful transactions
* Total failed transactions

One aggregation:

```js
db.transactions.aggregate([
  {
    $group: {
      _id: "$status",
      totalAmount: { $sum: "$amount" },
      count: { $sum: 1 }
    }
  }
])
```

This powers:

* Admin dashboards
* Monitoring systems
* Financial reports

